      <Outcome>k__BackingField:
        <Text>k__BackingField: 
        <Effects>k__BackingField: []
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Guess the direction
    <RequiredItem>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    <Outcome>k__BackingField:
      <Text>k__BackingField: Lucky guess! The trail appears right in front of you.
      <Effects>k__BackingField:
